<title>USA: First Industrial forms development unit.</title>
<headline>First Industrial forms development unit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Industrial Realty Trust Inc said Monday it formed a wholly owned subsidiary, Development Services Group (DSG).</p>
<p>First Industrial, which owns, manages, acquires and develops bulk warehouses and light incustrial properties, said the subsidiary was formed it meet its increased customer demand for build-to-suit development projects and to expand present development capabilities.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
